 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "The adjunction $Rf_!^c\\dashv Rf^!_c$",
 "statement": "In the situation of [def-sfb-dc-upper-shriek-of-compactification], the adjunction\n\n$$\nRf_!^c\\dashv Rf^!_c\n$$\n\nbetween $Rf_!^c=Rp_*\\circ i_!$ of [sk-def-sfb-dc-lower-shriek] and $Rf^!_c=Li^*\\circ Rp^!$ is the\ncomposite of the adjunction $i_!\\dashv Li^*$ of [def-sfb-dc-open-lower-shriek-adjunction] with the\nadjunction $Rp_*\\dashv Rp^!$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/main-20261015/blueprint/sec-six-functors-basics/sk-def-sfb-dc-upper-shriek/def-sfb-dc-upper-shriek-of-compactification-adjunction.md",
